<form class="tsru-aha-config-form">
  <header><h2><i class="fas fa-masks-theater"></i> Aha Instant</h2><p>Configure the GM-only floating button and the WebM broadcast to all connected players.</p></header>
  <section class="tsru-elation-settings">
    <h3><i class="fas fa-masks-theater"></i> Elation &amp; Punchline</h3>
    <div class="tsru-aha-config-field"><label><strong>Elation on Team?</strong><small>Master switch for Punchline and every Aha Instant feature.</small></label><input type="checkbox" name="elationEnabled" {{checked config.elationEnabled}}></div>
    <div class="tsru-aha-config-field"><label><strong>Elation Path</strong><small>Characters assigned this Path use their personal Punchline Gain modifier. Other characters generate +1.</small></label><select name="elationPathId"><option value="">— Select a Path —</option>{{#each paths}}<option value="{{this.id}}" {{#if this.selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{this.name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></div>
    <div class="tsru-aha-config-field"><label><strong>Current Punchline</strong><small>Shared Punchline total displayed to the party.</small></label><input type="number" name="punchline" min="0" step="1" value="{{punchline}}"></div>
    <div class="tsru-aha-config-field"><label><strong>Punchline icon</strong><small>Shown where the mask appears in the Punchline counter.</small></label><div class="tsru-file-control"><input type="text" name="punchlineIcon" value="{{config.punchlineIcon}}" placeholder="Choose an image"><button type="button" class="file-picker" data-type="image" data-target="punchlineIcon" title="Browse Files"><i class="fas fa-file-import"></i></button></div></div>
    <div class="tsru-aha-config-field"><label><strong>Punchline number font</strong><small>Upload or select a TTF, OTF, WOFF, or WOFF2 font.</small></label><div class="tsru-file-control"><input type="text" name="punchlineFontFile" value="{{config.punchlineFontFile}}" placeholder="Choose a font"><button type="button" class="file-picker" data-type="any" data-target="punchlineFontFile" title="Browse Files"><i class="fas fa-file-import"></i></button></div></div>
    <button type="button" data-action="show-punchline"><i class="fas fa-eye"></i> Show Punchline Counter</button>
  </section>
  <div class="tsru-aha-config-field"><label><strong>WebM video</strong><small>Played over the battle map and beneath Foundry's interface.</small></label><div class="tsru-file-control"><input type="text" name="video" value="{{config.video}}" placeholder="Choose a WebM file"><button type="button" class="file-picker" data-type="video" data-target="video" title="Browse Files"><i class="fas fa-file-import"></i></button></div></div>
  <div class="tsru-aha-config-field"><label><strong>Button artwork</strong><small>Cropped into the circular floating button.</small></label><div class="tsru-file-control"><input type="text" name="buttonImage" value="{{config.buttonImage}}" placeholder="Choose an image"><button type="button" class="file-picker" data-type="image" data-target="buttonImage" title="Browse Files"><i class="fas fa-file-import"></i></button></div></div>
  <div class="tsru-aha-config-field"><label><strong>Button color</strong><small>Controls the ring, glow, and label accent.</small></label><div class="tsru-color-control"><input type="color" value="{{config.color}}" data-color-for="color"><input type="text" name="color" value="{{config.color}}"></div></div>
  <section class="tsru-aha-initiative-settings">
    <h3><i class="fas fa-list-ol"></i> Aha Instant Initiative Settings</h3>
    <div class="tsru-aha-config-field"><label><strong>Add Aha Instant to initiative</strong><small>Creates one Aha Instant combatant when initiative is rolled.</small></label><input type="checkbox" name="initiativeEnabled" {{checked config.initiativeEnabled}}></div>
    <div class="tsru-aha-config-field"><label><strong>Turn position</strong><small>Aha Instant automatically stays one initiative point below the lowest rolled combatant, including negative rolls and ties.</small></label><strong>Always Last</strong></div>
    <div class="tsru-aha-config-field"><label><strong>Initiative image</strong><small>Custom portrait shown for Aha Instant in the combat tracker.</small></label><div class="tsru-file-control"><input type="text" name="combatantImage" value="{{config.combatantImage}}" placeholder="Choose an image"><button type="button" class="file-picker" data-type="image" data-target="combatantImage" title="Browse Files"><i class="fas fa-file-import"></i></button></div></div>
    <button type="button" data-action="sync-aha-initiative"><i class="fas fa-rotate"></i> Add/Refresh Aha Combatant Now</button>
  </section>
  <div class="tsru-aha-config-actions"><button type="button" data-action="preview-aha"><i class="fas fa-eye"></i> Preview Locally</button><button type="button" data-action="show-aha-button"><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> Show Floating Button</button><button type="submit"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save</button></div>
</form>
